% SPDX-License-Identifier: EUPL-1.2
% =====================================================================
% parameters.clausal -- the PROVENANCE records of the sourced figures of
% eu/ai_act/deployer_duties_fria. PROVENANCE ONLY: this file references each figure by
% name and holds no value, and the logic modules do not import it.
%
% If parameters-sources.yaml is the COMMISSIONING REGISTER (its first line
% says so), then for EACH of its keys:
%   1. the VALUE is a fact in the determination slice that READS it
%      (that slice's .clausal file), never here;
%   2. this file holds its provenance record, a fact:
%        parameter_source(<key>, [label-'...', ref-'...', verbatim-'...']).
%      with the verbatim pair OMITTED while the yaml entry is
%      `status: unverified`.
% Otherwise this file holds no records at the baseline.
%
% This package's parameters-sources.yaml is NOT a commissioning register,
% so this file holds no records. The statutory figures of the order (the
% Chapter III dates 2 December 2027 and 2 August 2028 of Art 113(c)(i) and
% (ii), the dates 31 December 2030 of Art 111(1) and 2 August 2030 of
% Art 111(2), and the six-month minimum of Art 26(6) as the integer 6) are
% declared once in the determination slice deployer_duties_fria.clausal
% with :- constant_value(Name, Value). and traced through the citation keys
% recorded in citations.clausal.
% =====================================================================

:- module(parameters, []).

:- end_module(parameters).
